          "description": "Parked to free the active slot for T416. COME BACK TO THIS — one item left. All four exposé items are built and driven by Antonio (floats drawn, unequal pane heights proportional, x/r/d delete through the ActionRegistry, open/close zoom). What remains: the EXIT plays the fade over the shrink. `Fade::delay` and `LayerRegistry::set_fade_out_after` were built for it and reverted — a layer is retired when the fade finishes, so delaying the fade left the cards on screen after the map had gone. Sequencing the exit needs a layer's lifetime to follow the WHOLE exit, which is T417 (the surface tree) territory. Both APIs remain in heca-grid-ui, correct and unused. Parked 2026-08-12."
